{"beat": 4, "name": "CHAPTER 1 — THE DICE", "text": "Now go and interview the top tenth. Every one of them can tell you, truthfully, what they did. They reordered on schedule. They held their price through the slow months. They kept the ads running. And every one of those things is also what the bottom tenth did, because it is the same plan. The gap between $1,014,998 and $924,168 is which days the customers came, and nothing else. That gap is $65,320. It's 7% of the median outcome, produced by the order the demand arrived in. If you only ever hear from the top, you will credit all of it to the moves. The moves were shared. The outcome wasn't. And the story the winners tell about the moves will be sincere, detailed, and wrong about what caused what.", "provider": "library", "words": [{"word": "Now", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.139}, {"word": "go", "start": 0.186, "end": 0.279}, {"word": "and", "start": 0.337, "end": 0.406}, {"word": "interview", "start": 0.453, "end": 0.755}, {"word": "the", "start": 0.813, "end": 0.882}, {"word": "top", "start": 0.917, "end": 1.091}, {"word": "tenth.", "start": 1.161, "end": 1.567}, {"word": "Every", "start": 2.171, "end": 2.461}, {"word": "one", "start": 2.519, "end": 2.659}, {"word": "of", "start": 2.682, "end": 2.728}, {"word": "them", "start": 2.775, "end": 2.891}, {"word": "can", "start": 2.949, "end": 3.065}, {"word": "tell", "start": 3.111, "end": 3.274}, {"word": "you,", "start": 3.332, "end": 3.437}, {"word": "truthfully,", "start": 3.46, "end": 3.959}, {"word": "what", "start": 3.982, "end": 4.11}, {"word": "they", "start": 4.145, "end": 4.261}, {"word": "did.", "start": 4.319, "end": 4.69}, {"word": "They", "start": 4.899, "end": 5.097}, {"word": "reordered", "start": 5.166, "end": 5.666}, {"word": "on", "start": 5.712, "end": 5.782}, {"word": "schedule.", "start": 5.851, "end": 6.478}, {"word": "They", "start": 6.513, "end": 6.711}, {"word": "held", "start": 6.792, "end": 6.966}, {"word": "their", "start": 7.001, "end": 7.11